  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n1.7 % of 800 × 2.5 % of a = 382.5\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx% = x/100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n1.7 % of 800 × 2.5 % of a = 382.5\n\n⇒ (1.7)/(100)×800 times (2.5)/(100)times a= 382.5\n\n⇒ (17)/(1000)×800 times (25)/(1000)times a= 382.5\n\n⇒ 13.6 × (a/40) = 382.5\n\n⇒ (a/40) = 382.5/13.6\n\n⇒ (a/40) = 28.125\n\n⇒ a = 28.125 × 40 = 1125\n\n**∴ The value of a is 1125.**",
